## 1. File Structure Overview

The template splits its CSS into **one base file + three page-specific files**. Each page imports the base (`templatemo-axis-industrial.css`) and then its own file on top.

| File | Purpose | Page |
|---|---|---|
| `templatemo-axis-industrial.css` | Global base styles, variables, utilities | All pages |
| `templatemo-axis-landing-page.css` | Hero product section, spec grid, stat cards, CTA band, terminal log ticker | Landing / Product page |
| `templatemo-axis-main-page.css` | Bento grid layout, sticky stack cards, index hero | Index / Home page |
| `templatemo-axis-the-observer.css` | Shell + sidebar layout, radar hero, ribbon metrics, features grid, signal visualizer | The Observer page |

