## 2. CSS Custom Properties (Variables)

These variables are defined in the **base file** (`templatemo-axis-industrial.css`) and are used across all three page-specific files. You need to understand them before touching any component.

### Color Palette

```css
--ink:      #0A0A08;   /* Near-black — used for dark backgrounds, borders, text */
--base:     #F5F5F0;   /* Off-white — main background, light card surfaces */
--surface:  #EDEDEA;   /* Slightly darker off-white — section backgrounds */
--safety:   #FF3E00;   /* Bright orange-red — the brand accent color */
--muted:    #888;      /* Medium grey — secondary text */

/* Terminal / code block colors */
--term-bg:    #0D0D0B;   /* Almost black — terminal/sidebar background */
--term-green: #00FF66;   /* Bright green — terminal text, OK status */
--term-amber: #FFAA00;   /* Amber — warning status in logs */
```

**Key design insight:** This template uses only 3 main colors (black, off-white, orange-red) plus terminal greens. There is no blue, purple, or typical "corporate" palette.

### Typography Scale

```css
--fs-hero:     clamp(8rem, 22vw, 22rem);   /* Massive hero headings */
--fs-h1:       clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);   /* Section headings */
--fs-h2:       clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.8rem); /* Card/block headings */
--fs-h3:       clamp(1.2rem, 2vw, 1.8rem); /* Sub-headings */
--fs-data:     clamp(0.875rem, 1.2vw, 1rem); /* Body / data text */
--fs-micro:    0.65rem;                    /* Labels, tags, metadata */
--fs-spec-val: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);  /* Spec numbers / stat values */
```

All sizes use `clamp()` for fluid typography — they scale smoothly between a minimum and maximum value based on viewport width.

### Spacing & Layout

```css
--gap:        clamp(1rem, 2vw, 2rem);   /* Grid gap — responsive */
--header-h:   64px;                      /* Fixed header height */
--sidebar-w:  340px;                     /* Observer page sidebar width */
```

### Borders & Shadows

```css
--border:        1px solid var(--ink);               /* Standard solid border */
--border-thin:   1px solid rgba(10,10,8,0.12);        /* Subtle divider */
--shadow:        8px 8px 0px var(--ink);              /* Hard drop shadow */
--shadow-safety: 8px 8px 0px var(--safety);           /* Orange accent shadow */
```

**Design style note:** Hard/offset box shadows (no blur, solid color) give the template its brutalist/industrial look.

