## 6. Shared Patterns Across Files

### 6.1 The "Hard Hover" Pattern

All cards and interactive elements use `transition: none` — hover effects are **instant**, not animated. Combined with the translate + shadow shift, this creates a mechanical, deliberate feel.

```css
/* This pattern repeats across all files */
.card { transition: none; }
.card:hover {
    transform: translate(-4px, -4px);
    box-shadow: 12px 12px 0px var(--ink);
}
```

### 6.2 The About Section

All three pages have an identical `.about` section at the bottom:

```css
.about { padding: ...; border-bottom: var(--border); background: var(--surface); }
.about__inner { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; }
```

### 6.3 Typography Fonts

All three files use the same font stack (defined in the base):
- **Headings / numbers:** `Space Grotesk` — geometric sans-serif
- **Body text:** Implied sans (base style)
- **Monospace / code / units:** `JetBrains Mono`

