## 7. Responsive Breakpoints Summary

| Breakpoint | What changes |
|---|---|
| `≤ 1024px` | 12-col grids go to 6-col, sidebar hides, spec grid to 2-col, ribbon to 3-col |
| `≤ 768px` | All multi-column layouts go to 1-col, stack cards lose sticky, buttons go full-width |
| `≤ 480px` | Ribbon stacks to 1-col, CTA actions stack vertically, all buttons full-width |

